# From original_saves/independence-seed-100/000002.SAV (Netherlands, Spring 1681, turn 270, the
# turn after the declaration of independence; docs/idle_independence.md) with every human map
# unit that had no standing orders sentried through sav_json, re-saved once by the port. The
# human idles five turns of the War of Independence: Space ends each turn, every popup (REF
# landings, Tory attacks and captures, coastal fort fire and native raids raised inside the AI /
# end-of-turn pump, colony reports, Continental Army promotions) is answered with its default
# row, units that wake up are sentried again. Drift guard over the King's REF turn.
